	(descr "SCHURTER SCPC Case SS17 prismatic supercapacitor (P/N 3-153-440), 1.8 F 2.75 V, ESR 25 mOhm. Flat prismatic cell 39.0 x 17.0 mm, 1.70 mm max thick. Under-body solder pads only: N 12.25 x 3.5 and P 7.75 x 3.5, centred +/-16.25 mm from cell centre (outer edge 1.5 mm in from each end). Asymmetric pad widths are the polarity key (N wider than P). The end tabs (drawn on F.Fab, ~2.75 mm past each end) are finish-coated locators, NOT solder pads. Derived from the locked WS17 land (solarglow:SC1): pad geometry identical, pads moved +/-11 -> +/-16.25 and body 28.5 -> 39.0 for the SS17 case.")
	(tags "supercapacitor SCHURTER SCPC SS17 3-153-440 prismatic")
